  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix: web by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1249\n* fix: web by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1250\n* Add a Debian install section by @barnumbirr in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1251\n* build(deps): bump golang.org/x/net from 0.57.0 to 0.58.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1253\n* build(deps): bump github.com/stretchr/testify from 1.11.1 to 1.12.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1252\n* fear: improve transfer performance by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1254\n\n## New Contributors\n* @barnumbirr made their first contribution in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1251\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schollz/croc/compare/v11.1.1...v11.1.2",
